---

<section id="download" class="container-page py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="card relative overflow-hidden p-10 sm:p-14 glow">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 grid-pattern opacity-30" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="relative flex flex-col items-start gap-6 max-w-2xl">
      <span class="badge badge-accent">v1.0.0 · 2026-08</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl text-balance">
        把 Agent 装进你的手机
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
        当前 v1.0.0 仅<strong class="font-medium text-[var(--color-text)]">手机形态</strong>侧载分发,平板支持已开放但暂不随手机包上架。AppGallery 审核中。
      </p>

      <div class="mt-2 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 w-full max-w-xl">
        <a href="#" class="btn-primary justify-start">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4" />
            <polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10" />
            <line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3" />
          </svg>
          侧载 APK
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="btn-secondary justify-start">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" />
            <line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21" />
            <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21" />
          </svg>
          AppGallery · 审核中
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-1 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
        <p>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs">SHA-256</span> ·
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[var(--color-text-subtle)] break-all">
            签名证书: <span class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">填入 release HAP 实际指纹</span>
          </span>
        </p>
        <p>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs">系统要求</span> ·
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">HarmonyOS 5.0+ (API 12+)</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>